        "label": "1st quarter",
        "score": "MIL 27, BOS 25",
        "text": "Kyle Kuzma scored 14 points in the first five minutes, hitting 4 of 5 threes, and Milwaukee led 20–6. His basket with 4:17 left made it 27–15, and the Bucks didn't score again in the quarter. Mitchell Robinson came in for Neemias Queta and Tatum made 4 of 6 threes in the quarter."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd quarter",
        "score": "BOS 58, MIL 45",
        "text": "The run reached 18–0 for a 33–27 lead as Milwaukee went 6:29 without a point. George scored 16 on 6-of-9 shooting in the quarter, his best stretch since the opener."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd quarter",
        "score": "BOS 91, MIL 74",
        "text": "Mike Conley's three made it 70–47. Robinson made three straight shots, and Sam Hauser's runner at the buzzer ended the quarter."
      },
      {
        "label": "4th quarter",
        "score": "Final: BOS 117, MIL 97",
        "text": "Payton Pritchard hit three straight threes to open the quarter, and Tatum sat the whole fourth."
      }
